   "textLength": 2140,
   "text": "\"Claude scopes the request, delegates the work, coordinates parallel threads, reviews the outputs, and assembles the finished result,\" the company explains in a blog post. \"You can steer progress throughout, even from your phone, and it keeps working after you step away from your computer.\"\nIt's the sort of capability that might be useful if you are prompting the model to begin a large coding proj",
